Application icons
-----------------
No third-party application icon set is included. See assets/README.txt for the
source and license of the project-authored action icons and application mark.

Bundled fallback fonts
----------------------
eframe/epaint_default_fonts 0.33.3 bundles the following fallback fonts:
Source: https://github.com/emilk/egui/tree/0.33.3/crates/epaint_default_fonts
- Hack: notices and terms in licenses/fonts/Hack-Regular.txt.
- Ubuntu Light: Ubuntu Font Licence, licenses/fonts/UFL.txt.
- Noto Emoji: SIL Open Font License, licenses/fonts/OFL.txt.
- emoji-icon-font: MIT, licenses/fonts/emoji-icon-font-mit-license.txt.
These are library-provided font resources, not the application's action icons.
System fonts are loaded from the host and are not copied into this repository.

Rust dependencies
-----------------
Cargo.lock records exact dependency versions. Dependencies retain their upstream
licenses and notices. This file currently records artwork and bundled fonts;
it is not a complete binary-distribution license inventory. A distributable
package must additionally include the required notices for its resolved libraries.
